    "the frozen controller and static comparator artifacts remain tbd",
    "the H1 diagnostic model, H2 model suite, and one-sided analysis runner remain unpinned",
    "geometry gain thresholds, low/high geometry profiles, nested trial rows per family, joint-gate dependence source and effect scenarios, selected maximum family count, joint-power lower bound, and design report remain tbd",
